2. Update the _ds_manifest.json to include the new component
3. Refactor all the call sites to use the new component

Since I don't have the exact variations from each call site, I'll create a flexible component that accepts:
- className (for additional classes)
- children (the content)
- Any other props that might be needed based on common usage patterns

